[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_01_0010","text":"总觉得……好开心……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_01_0020","text":"……？　是吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_01_0030","text":"是啊！\n不管来几次都觉得好开心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_01_0040","text":"……呵呵\n我也，好开心呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_01_0050","text":"真乃也是？\n嘿嘿……呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_01_0060","text":"与其说是“采购很开心”，\n不如说是跟真乃和灯织在一起，所以“采购也很开心”这种感觉？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_01_0070","text":"能懂我的意思吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_01_0080","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_01_0090","text":"原来如此，这么说的话我就明白了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_01_0100","text":"太好了！\n明明是来准备野餐的，准备工作就这么开心，开心得不得了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
